  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Business Investment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Connectivity and Coastal Resilience Compact - Agricultural Business Investment Project: The Promoting Reform and Investment in Agriculture Project (PRIA) seeks to increase agricultural investment as well as the productivity and incomes of smallholder farmers and other value chain actors in Mozambique. This will be achieved by improving the investment climate through fiscal reform and by enabling and incentivizing commercial aggregators in Zambezia to integrate smallholder farmers, prioritizing women, into their value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
